WEBVTT

00:08:56.273 --> 00:09:00.082
kwa pesa takriban 
trilioni moja dola za Marekani.

00:09:00.527 --> 00:09:03.727
Na bado wanabinafsisha faida.

00:09:04.614 --> 00:09:07.520
Mwaka 2015, jimbo la Quebec,

00:09:07.544 --> 00:09:09.751
mahakama ilidhihirisa 
kuwa sekta ya tumbaku

00:09:09.775 --> 00:09:12.575
ilikuwaimesababisha hayo maafa ya afya

00:09:12.599 --> 00:09:15.075
na ikaishurutisha kulipa 
dola bilioni 15 za Marekani.

00:09:15.457 --> 00:09:17.236
Hiyo kesi iko katika mahakama ya rufaa.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:23.379
Lakini swali ni,
mbona yeyote kati

00:09:23.403 --> 00:09:26.878
yetu wa nchi yoyote, 
alipe gharama ya sekta ya tumbaku?

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:32.062
Tusonge kwa ugavi na maafa huko.